# Protected health information and case evidence must never enter git history.
disputes/**/evidence/*
!disputes/**/evidence/README.md

# Generated/filled correspondence containing real personal data.
# Templates are tracked; anything marked FILLED is not.
**/*.FILLED.md
**/*-FILLED.*

